  "referenceHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2872\" class=\"elementor elementor-2872\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88c502c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"88c502c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df6c749 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"df6c749\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01d9285 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01d9285\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"380\">British-born Hong Kong artisan Rickie Cheuk is a materials explorer whose practice centres around experimental making and circular design. Working across disciplines, he creates objects using waste materials sourced from a range of industries, reimagining the overlooked or discarded with inventive craftsmanship.<br><br></p><p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"575\">Most recently, Rickie salvaged piping and old sinks from the demolition of a residential home, transforming the waste material into chopsticks, merging structure, materiality, and storytelling.<br><br></p><p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"697\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">For further information on pricing and availability for Rickie’s work, please contact<br><br data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"665\"><strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"697\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"695\">info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk</a></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cbb9cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9cbb9cb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a1acae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8a1acae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2560\" src=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2594\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-scaled.jpeg 2048w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-240x300.jpeg 240w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-819x1024.jpeg 819w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-768x960.jpeg 768w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-1229x1536.jpeg 1229w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Rickie-Headshot-1638x2048.jpeg 1638w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-660e48b b2artists e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"660e48b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<di